<title>GERMANY: PAN-GERMAN JULY CPI INFLATION 1.9 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>PAN-GERMAN JULY CPI INFLATION 1.9 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:  GERMAN CPI</p>
<p>INFLATION		July 97     June 97    July 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.5	  +0.2	 +0.3</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.9	  +1.7	 +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    119.2	 118.6	117.0</p>
<p> FINAL WEST GERMAN CPI INFLATION July 97     June 97    July 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.4	  +0.3	 +0.4</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)		 +1.7	  +1.7	 +1.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    116.6	 116.1	114.6</p>
<p> EAST GERMAN CPI INFLATION	 July 97     June 97    July 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)	 +0.7	  +0.1	 +0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year			    +2.4	  +1.9	 +3.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    139.3	 138.4	136.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
